"environment_description": "Large, overlapping pale-golden sand dunes surround a curving desert highway, with almost no natural ground vegetation. The visible dry season has warm beige sand, dusty olive-green date palms, no autumn colours and no snow. Dark brown-grey asphalt carries faded white markings and is bordered by sandy shoulders, black steel posts and thin galvanized barrier cables. Tall galvanized streetlights, brown utility poles and a delicate distant transmission tower punctuate the landscape. Low warm sunlight from the left highlights the dune crests and palm fronds, casting long shadows toward the right foreground beneath a clear pale cyan sky.",
